                {
                    "title": "The Ghoomakkads - Let's Explore India",
                    "description": "Created an AI-driven travel planning platform with personalized recommendations. Integrated features like Ghoom-Bot, Surprise Trip Planner, and Safety Analyzer. Improved travel decision accuracy using preference-based recommendation logic."
